# 1Password env-file for scripts/newsletter-mail-servers.spec.json — PROD target
# (GOL-3455). Sibling of newsletter-mail-servers.env.op, which targets QA.
#
# WHY A SEPARATE FILE: `op run --env-file` values WIN over variables already in
# the shell, so `env ODOO_XMLRPC_URL=… op run --env-file=<qa file>` still talks
# to QA (measured 2026-11-07: the "override the ODOO_* vars" recipe silently hit
# the torn-down QA host and timed out). Never override; pick the file.
#
# COMMITTED — holds op:// REFERENCES, never secret values.
#
# Read-only verification (safe any time, exit 0 = all assertions hold, 2 = drift):
#   PROD_RECONFIG_CONFIRM=yes op run --env-file=scripts/newsletter-mail-servers.prod.env.op -- \
#     python3 scripts/prod-reconfig.py --target prod \
#       --spec scripts/newsletter-mail-servers.spec.json --check
#
# Apply (creates the four news.<domain> ir.mail_server rows + flips
# mass_mailing.outgoing_mail_server; idempotent). The API key below is the
# `Odoo - Prod Drift Readonly` item and is designated for READS. For --apply,
# Josh swaps the key line for his own item on the fly (board approval on the
# GOL-3455 thread) — see RUNBOOK-release-train.md gate "newsletter bulk mail
# servers", step 3b. A shell ODOO_API_KEY=… would be overridden by this file.
#
# HISTORY: the Train #4 QA leg of this spec never ran (QA torn down 2026-11-05
# before the --apply), so the QA->prod promotion did NOT carry these rows; prod
# was verified bare on 2026-11-07 (1 transactional row, 0 news rows, param absent).

# ── Odoo XML-RPC target: PROD ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
ODOO_XMLRPC_URL="https://odoo.gatheringatthegrove.com"
ODOO_DB="odoo"
ODOO_LOGIN="op://Grove Prod/bun2w6x634mr6jtfetx4ej3dle/username"
ODOO_API_KEY="op://Grove Prod/bun2w6x634mr6jtfetx4ej3dle/credential"

# ── Mailgun relay (non-secret constants) ──────────────────────────────────────
NEWS_SMTP_HOST="smtp.mailgun.org"
NEWS_SMTP_PORT="587"

# ── per-brand SMTP logins: 1P `Goldberry Grove - Admin` → `Mailgun | Goldberry Grove`
# (item 7t2pap33hu37bftpsy7uzmakuy). QA and prod share these domains + logins.
NEWS_SMTP_USER_HUB="op://Goldberry Grove - Admin/7t2pap33hu37bftpsy7uzmakuy/smtp_login_news_hub"
NEWS_SMTP_PASSWORD_HUB="op://Goldberry Grove - Admin/7t2pap33hu37bftpsy7uzmakuy/smtp_password_news_hub"
NEWS_SMTP_USER_GOLDBERRY="op://Goldberry Grove - Admin/7t2pap33hu37bftpsy7uzmakuy/smtp_login_news_goldberry"
NEWS_SMTP_PASSWORD_GOLDBERRY="op://Goldberry Grove - Admin/7t2pap33hu37bftpsy7uzmakuy/smtp_password_news_goldberry"
NEWS_SMTP_USER_NURSERY="op://Goldberry Grove - Admin/7t2pap33hu37bftpsy7uzmakuy/smtp_login_news_nursery"
NEWS_SMTP_PASSWORD_NURSERY="op://Goldberry Grove - Admin/7t2pap33hu37bftpsy7uzmakuy/smtp_password_news_nursery"
